(7468969, 1185724, 182284, '<td valign="top">This is adorable. The dress, little angle and the entire photo speaks Victoriana. Great Job. I gave a 10 for this and congratulations for a well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'This is adorable. The dress, little angle and the entire photo speaks Victoriana. Great Job. I gave a 10 for this and congratulations for a well deserved ribbon.', '2016-08-19 03:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
